<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>SEE YOU IN HELL</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">BEAUTY SCHOOL DROPOUT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">WE MADE PLANS &amp; GOD LAUGHED</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">36EARAnkdW8h0U4tZdRbg8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.550" end="00:18.550">Our love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.840" end="00:23.340">Never meant much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.670" end="00:25.570">At least not much to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.570" end="00:27.070">Heart strings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.340" end="00:27.840">Tying me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.700" end="00:30.710">They hang me like a noose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.710" end="00:32.210">Your touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.380" end="00:32.880">Hurts so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.640" end="00:34.780">Too good to refuse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.780" end="00:36.320">Now its toxic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.320" end="00:37.820">Twisted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.400" end="00:39.890">I can't take the abuse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.890" end="00:41.390">Ya I'm Sick of hearing you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.190" end="00:42.690">That I'm never enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.380" end="00:43.880">Ya Cause You don't ever want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.860" end="00:45.360">Til I'm making you ____</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.110" end="00:46.610">I'm Sorry for the mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.160" end="00:47.660">I guess I'll hit it and run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.410" end="00:48.910">And I'll run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.040" end="00:50.380">And I'll run away singing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.380" end="00:53.790">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.790" end="00:55.290">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.240" end="00:58.720">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.720" end="01:01.030">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.030" end="01:02.530">Devilish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.900" end="01:03.420">Self destructive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.420" end="01:05.680">But I want it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.680" end="01:13.680">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.730" end="01:22.230">My name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.470" end="01:22.970">In your mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.620" end="01:25.560">You just can't spit it out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.560" end="01:27.060">You say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.290" end="01:27.790">You have your doubts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.600" end="01:29.920">But you still stick around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.920" end="01:32.840">I said don't waste your time on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.840" end="01:35.200">I don't care what you think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.200" end="01:38.460">Don't want your love anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.460" end="01:41.400">Ya I'm Sick of hearing you say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.400" end="01:42.900">That I'm never enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.220" end="01:43.910">Ya Cause You don't ever want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.910" end="01:45.410">Til I'm making you cum</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.040" end="01:46.540">I'm Sorry for the mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.150" end="01:47.650">I guess I'll hit it and run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.530" end="01:49.790">And I'll run and I'll run and I'll run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.790" end="01:51.290">HA SING IT</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.640" end="01:53.560">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.560" end="01:55.620">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.620" end="01:59.050">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.050" end="02:01.030">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.030" end="02:02.530">Devilish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.920" end="02:03.530">Self destructive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.530" end="02:05.870">But I want it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.870" end="02:13.870">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.830" end="02:38.820">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.820" end="02:40.930">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.930" end="02:43.600">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.600" end="02:45.830">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.830" end="02:47.330">Devilish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.940" end="02:48.440">Self destructive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.290" end="02:49.900">But I want it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.900" end="02:56.340">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.340" end="02:57.840">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.570" end="03:01.050">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.050" end="03:03.660">Na na na na na na</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.660" end="03:06.160">I'll see you in hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.160" end="03:07.660">Devilish</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.920" end="03:08.510">Self destructive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.510" end="03:13.920">But I want it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.920" end="03:17.920">I'll see you in hell</p></div></body></tt>